    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "重大事件",
    title: "美國牙科福利管理商 DentaQuest 遭駭，數千萬用戶敏感醫療資料外洩",
    summary: "美國牙科與視力福利管理商 DentaQuest 於 7 月 17 日通報資安事件，確認駭客於 5 月 17 日至 20 日期間取得其部分網路系統的存取權。根據報導，至少有 1,500 萬名用戶受影響，外部研究人員推估實際影響人數可能超過 2,340 萬人。DentaQuest 服務涵蓋全美 50 州約 3,500 萬人，此次事件已成為自 2009 年以來規模最大的醫療資料外洩事件之一。受竊資料包含用戶的姓名、地址、社會安全號碼、會員識別碼、Medicare 與 Medicaid 編號，以及部分診斷、治療與帳務資訊。勒索組織 ShinyHunters 已聲稱犯案，並公開約 234GB 據稱竊自 DentaQuest 的資料。由於涉及大量敏感的醫療與個人身份識別資訊，用戶應提高警覺，注意帳戶異常活動，並留意官方後續修補與通知。本事件凸顯了醫療產業在資料保護與資安管理上的重大風險。",
    tags: ["DentaQuest", "醫療資料外洩", "HIPAA", "社會安全號碼", "勒索軟體", "美國醫療"],
    title_en: "U.S. Dental Benefits Manager DentaQuest Hacked, Millions of Users' Sensitive Medical Data Leaked",
    summary_en: "DentaQuest, a dental and vision benefits manager in the U.S., reported a security incident on July 17, confirming that hackers gained access to some of its network systems between May 17 and May 20. According to reports, at least 15 million users were affected, with external researchers estimating the actual number of affected individuals may exceed 23.4 million. DentaQuest serves approximately 35 million people across 50 states in the U.S., and this incident is one of the largest medical data leaks since 2009. Stolen data includes users' names, addresses, Social Security Numbers, member IDs, Medicare and Medicaid numbers, as well as some diagnostic, treatment, and billing information. The ransomware group ShinyHunters has claimed responsibility and publicly released approximately 234GB of data allegedly stolen from DentaQuest. Due to the involvement of a large amount of sensitive medical and personally identifiable information, users should remain vigilant, monitor for unusual account activity, and pay attention to official follow-up patches and notifications. This incident highlights the significant risks faced by the healthcare industry regarding data protection and cybersecurity management.",
    tags_en: ["DentaQuest", "Medical Data Leak", "HIPAA", "Social Security Number", "Ransomware", "U.S. Healthcare"],
    sources: [
      { name: "iThome", url: "https://ithome.com.tw/news/177819", lang: "ZH-TW" }
    ]
