    category: "Windows",
    title: "微軟宣布優化 Windows 11 記憶體佔用，目標讓 8GB RAM 也能提供流暢體驗",
    summary: "為回應用戶對 Windows 11 系統穩定性與資源佔用過高的抱怨，微軟（Microsoft）宣布多項優化計畫。特別是針對記憶體效率，微軟的執行副總裁 Pavan Davuluri 指出，系統正在透過更高效的記憶體分配器、優化 WinUI 3 以及 Chromium 和 Webview2 組件來降低整體記憶體佔用。其中一個重點目標是「針對 8GB 及以上記憶體進行優化」，旨在讓 Windows 11 在更低的記憶體配置下仍能提供快速且響應良好的體驗。這項舉動暗示了市場對高階 Copilot+ PC 的需求可能不如預期，或受限於記憶體的高昂價格。此外，微軟還將著力於提升開箱體驗、簡化家庭式父母控制功能，並讓應用程式間的語音互動更自然流暢。這些修補與優化旨在提升用戶滿意度，應對 PC 市場預計的下滑趨勢。",
    tags: ["Microsoft", "Windows 11", "記憶體優化", "Pavan Davuluri", "Copilot+", "WinUI 3"],
    title_en: "Microsoft announces Windows 11 memory optimization to ensure smooth experience even with 8GB RAM",
    summary_en: "In response to user complaints regarding Windows 11's system instability and high resource consumption, Microsoft has announced several optimization plans. Specifically focusing on memory efficiency, Microsoft Executive Vice President Pavan Davuluri noted that the system is reducing overall memory usage through a more efficient memory allocator, optimized WinUI 3, and optimized Chromium and Webview2 components. A key goal is to 'optimize for 8GB and above memory,' aiming to provide a fast and responsive experience with Windows 11 even on lower memory configurations. This move suggests that market demand for high-end Copilot+ PCs might be lower than anticipated, or constrained by the high cost of memory. Furthermore, Microsoft will focus on improving the out-of-box experience, simplifying family parental controls, and making in-app voice interactions more natural and fluid. These patches and optimizations aim to boost user satisfaction and address the anticipated decline in the PC market.",
    tags_en: ["Microsoft", "Windows 11", "Memory Optimization", "Pavan Davuluri", "Copilot+"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/os-platforms/2026/08/03/microsoft-says-8-gb-of-ram-should-be-enough-for-anyone-running-windows-11/5282153", lang: "EN" }
    ]
