    trackers: ["eu_cra"],
    category: "產業動態",
    title: "Amano Korea與Bionever簽署共同開發AI基礎停車與充電整合移動平台合作備忘錄",
    summary: "專精於停車管制及智慧移動基礎設施的Amano Korea（아마노코리아）與專精於AI基礎電動車充電解決方案的Bionever（바이온에버）簽署了策略性業務合作協議（MOU）。本次合作旨在將電動車充電服務從單純的設備建置，發展為整合了停車、出入、支付系統與AI基礎充電平台的智慧基礎設施。雙方計畫結合Amano Korea的停車營運經驗，以及Bionever的AI充電平台（CSMS）和預測維護技術，打造出停車與充電整合的下一代智慧移動平台。特別是，未來還計劃將停車機器人與AI充電系統連動，擴大業務範圍至可自動執行停車與充電的未來無人移動服務。此平台預計能提升大型商業設施、公共設施、物流設施等各類空間的營運效率與使用者便利性。",
    tags: ["Amano Korea", "Bionever", "電動車充電", "智慧移動", "AI", "停車機器人", "MOU"],
    title_en: "Amano Korea and Bionever Sign MOU to Co-develop Integrated AI-Based Parking and Charging Mobility Platform",
    summary_en: "Amano Korea, specializing in parking control and smart mobility infrastructure, and Bionever, specializing in AI-based EV charging solutions, have signed a strategic Memorandum of Understanding (MOU). This collaboration aims to evolve EV charging services from mere equipment installation into a smart infrastructure that integrates parking, access control, payment systems, and an AI-based charging platform. The two companies plan to combine Amano Korea's parking operation expertise with Bionever's AI charging platform (CSMS) and predictive maintenance technology to create a next-generation smart mobility platform that integrates parking and charging. Notably, they also plan to link parking robots with the AI charging system, expanding their scope to future unmanned mobility services that can automatically handle both parking and charging. This platform is expected to enhance operational efficiency and user convenience across various spaces, including large commercial facilities, public facilities, and logistics centers.",
    tags_en: ["Amano Korea", "Bionever", "EV Charging", "Smart Mobility", "AI", "Parking Robot", "MOU"],
